; The arms of a returned value `if` settle on the wider one
; (Planner.settle_value_arms#), and the arm that made the value wide is the
; one named: it narrows into the routine's result. Until 2026-11-10 the
; implicit return of such a value answered the low bits at rc 0.
; xfail: the returned value narrows int into i32

function f(c: int, k: i32, big: int) returns i32
{
    if c > k: k else big
}

if (f(1, 2, 4294967303) as int) = 7
    print "PASS"
